<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  {{>head}}
  <body>
    <main>
      <table {{{containerstyle}}}>
        <tr>
          <td>{{> header}}</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>
            <table class="mobile-width" {{{bodytablestyle}}}>
              <tr>
                <td
                  style="
                    padding: 40px 30px;
                    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
                  "
                >
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 20px;
                      font-weight: 700;
                      color: #1d1c1d;
                      letter-spacing: -0.25px;
                      line-height: 28px;
                      margin: 0 0 16px 0;
                    "
                  >
                    Workspace Limit Reached for Domain
                  </div>
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 15px;
                      font-weight: 400;
                      color: #434245;
                      line-height: 22px;
                      margin: 0 0 24px 0;
                    "
                  >
                    <div>Hi Support Team,</div>
                    <div style="height: 12px; line-height: 12px;">&nbsp;</div>
                    <div>
                      A user with the email address <strong>{{userEmail}}</strong> attempted
                      to create a new workspace for the domain <strong>{{domain}}</strong>.
                    </div>
                    <div style="height: 12px; line-height: 12px;">&nbsp;</div>
                    <div>
                      The request was blocked because <strong>{{domain}}</strong> has already
                      reached the maximum allowed limit of <strong>{{limit}}</strong> active
                      workspaces on this platform.
                    </div>
                    <div style="height: 12px; line-height: 12px;">&nbsp;</div>
                    <div>
                      If this user should be granted access, please review the existing
                      workspaces for that domain or adjust the workspace limit accordingly.
                    </div>
                  </div>
                  <div
                    style="
                      font-size: 13px;
                      font-weight: 400;
                      color: #868686;
                      line-height: 20px;
                      border-top: 1px solid #e8e8e8;
                      padding-top: 16px;
                      margin-top: 8px;
                    "
                  >
                    This is an automated notification from PipesHub. No action is required
                    unless you wish to accommodate this user.
                  </div>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>{{> footer}}</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
